{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"LinkProps"},{"type":"text","value":" type extends the "},{"type":"link","href":"./ActiveLinkOptionsType.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ActiveLinkOptions"}]},{"type":"text","value":" and "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"React.AnchorHTMLAttributes<HTMLAnchorElement>"},{"type":"text","value":" types and contains additional props specific to the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Link"},{"type":"text","value":" component."}]},{"type":"code","value":"type LinkProps = ActiveLinkOptions &\n  Omit<React.AnchorHTMLAttributes<HTMLAnchorElement>, 'children'> & {\n    children?:\n      | React.ReactNode\n      | ((state: { isActive: boolean }) => React.ReactNode)\n  }","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"linkprops-properties","children":[{"type":"text","value":"LinkProps properties"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"All of the props from "},{"type":"link","href":"./ActiveLinkOptionsType.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ActiveLinkOptions"}]}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"All of the props from "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"React.AnchorHTMLAttributes<HTMLAnchorElement>"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"children","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"children"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type: "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"React.ReactNode | ((state: { isActive: boolean }) => React.ReactNode)"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Optional"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The children that will be rendered inside of the anchor element. If a function is provided, it will be called with an object that contains the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"isActive"},{"type":"text","value":" boolean value that can be used to determine if the link is active."}]}]}]}],"headings":[{"id":"linkprops-properties","text":"LinkProps properties","level":2},{"id":"children","text":"children","level":4}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nThe `LinkProps` type extends the [`ActiveLinkOptions`](./ActiveLinkOptionsType.md) and `React.AnchorHTMLAttributes<HTMLAnchorElement>` types and contains additional props specific to the `Link` component.\n\n```tsx\ntype LinkProps = ActiveLinkOptions &\n  Omit<React.AnchorHTMLAttributes<HTMLAnchorElement>, 'children'> & {\n    children?:\n      | React.ReactNode\n      | ((state: { isActive: boolean }) => React.ReactNode)\n  }\n```\n\n## LinkProps properties\n\n- All of the props from [`ActiveLinkOptions`](./ActiveLinkOptionsType.md)\n- All of the props from `React.AnchorHTMLAttributes<HTMLAnchorElement>`\n\n#### `children`\n\n- Type: `React.ReactNode | ((state: { isActive: boolean }) => React.ReactNode)`\n- Optional\n- The children that will be rendered inside of the anchor element. If a function is provided, it will be called with an object that contains the `isActive` boolean value that can be used to determine if the link is active.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: LinkPropsType\ntitle: LinkProps type\n---\n\nThe `LinkProps` type extends the [`ActiveLinkOptions`](./ActiveLinkOptionsType.md) and `React.AnchorHTMLAttributes<HTMLAnchorElement>` types and contains additional props specific to the `Link` component.\n\n```tsx\ntype LinkProps = ActiveLinkOptions &\n  Omit<React.AnchorHTMLAttributes<HTMLAnchorElement>, 'children'> & {\n    children?:\n      | React.ReactNode\n      | ((state: { isActive: boolean }) => React.ReactNode)\n  }\n```\n\n## LinkProps properties\n\n- All of the props from [`ActiveLinkOptions`](./ActiveLinkOptionsType.md)\n- All of the props from `React.AnchorHTMLAttributes<HTMLAnchorElement>`\n\n#### `children`\n\n- Type: `React.ReactNode | ((state: { isActive: boolean }) => React.ReactNode)`\n- Optional\n- The children that will be rendered inside of the anchor element. If a function is provided, it will be called with an object that contains the `isActive` boolean value that can be used to determine if the link is active.\n"}
